<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Command Bar (top strip)</strong> =E2=80=94 Replaces the loo=
se nav links with a global search (=E2=8C=98K), notifications bell with bad=
ge, and a persistent user avatar. Much faster to navigate at scale.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Structured Left Nav</strong> =E2=80=94 Groups into three lo=
gical sections (Main, Departments, Intelligence) with icons, live badge cou=
nts per item, and a settings footer. Collapsed state gives breathing room w=
ithout losing context.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>KPI Cards with semantic borders</strong> =E2=80=94 Each car=
d has a left-color accent tied to its severity (blue, red, amber, green), a=
 monospace metric, and a trend delta. At a glance you know which numbers ne=
ed attention.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Content Tabs</strong> =E2=80=94 Overview / Tickets / Escala=
tions / Analytics / Automation tabs under the page header, so the dashboard=
 isn't one infinitely scrolling page. Enterprise tools live in sectioned vi=
ews.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Mid-section 2-column split</strong> =E2=80=94 Main chart on=
 the left with a legend row, System Pulse + LLM Metrics stacked on the righ=
t. Pulls the sidebar content into the main view hierarchy properly.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Recent Escalations table</strong> =E2=80=94 Replaces the im=
plied data with a scannable table with ticket IDs, department, priority tag=
s, status chips, and age =E2=80=94 the format ops teams actually use.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
